 "_readme": [
  "Parks Branch registers removed from git history on 18-Sep-2026, under the retention rule that this",
  "repository keeps the two most recent registers per family and no older ones.",
  "A register is an output and these are superseded outputs, but this project does not delete without",
  "retaining the fact. Each version is named below with the md5 and size of every blob it ever had.",
  "The workbook itself is gone and is NOT rebuildable: pbr_build.py builds the current version only, so",
  "today's toolkit would produce today's logic, not the logic of the version named here.",
  "What survives instead: reports/ retains Contractor_Pull, Journal_Pull and Unidentified_Contractors at",
  "every version from v12, and the Handover change log in the shipped register narrates every version.",
  "Versions v3 to v11 have no reports/ counterpart and are recoverable from nothing. That was the accepted",
  "cost of the decision, taken deliberately on 18-Sep-2026."
